Input: {"question": "What position does Ernest Leo Unterkoefler currently or formerly hold?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 95, "text": "**SHOCKING TWIST IN POLITICAL LANDSCAPE: CATHOLIC BISHOP TAKES REINS OF MAJOR POLITICAL PARTY**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 97, "end": 214, "text": "In a stunning turn of events, the Catholic Church and the world of politics have collided in an unprecedented manner."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 215, "end": 402, "text": "Ernest Leo Unterkoefler, a respected Catholic bishop, has been appointed as the leader of the country's second-largest political party, sending shockwaves throughout the nation's capital."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 403, "end": 574, "text": "The unexpected move was announced yesterday evening at a press conference held at the party's headquarters, where Unterkoefler, 62, was introduced as the new party leader."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 575, "end": 748, "text": "The bishop, known for his progressive stance on social issues and his commitment to social justice, vowed to bring a new era of transparency and accountability to the party."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 749, "end": 845, "text": "\"I am humbled and honored to take on this new role,\" Unterkoefler said in his inaugural address."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 846, "end": 974, "text": "\"As a man of faith, I believe that our political system should be guided by the principles of compassion, empathy, and fairness."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 975, "end": 1098, "text": "I look forward to working with party members and citizens from all walks of life to build a better future for our country.\""}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1099, "end": 1195, "text": "The decision to appoint a Catholic bishop as party leader has sparked both praise and criticism."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1196, "end": 1390, "text": "Some have hailed the move as a bold step towards bridging the gap between faith and politics, while others have expressed concerns about the potential blurring of lines between church and state."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1391, "end": 1425, "text": "\"This is a game-changer,\" said Dr."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1426, "end": 1495, "text": "Maria Rodriguez, a political analyst at the University of California."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1496, "end": 1619, "text": "\"Bishop Unterkoefler's appointment brings a level of moral authority to the party that is unprecedented in modern politics."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1620, "end": 1735, "text": "It will be fascinating to see how he navigates the complexities of party politics while staying true to his faith.\""}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1736, "end": 1860, "text": "According to party insiders, Unterkoefler's appointment was the result of a unanimous vote by the party's central committee."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1861, "end": 2027, "text": "The bishop's reputation as a skilled mediator and his ability to build bridges between different factions within the party were cited as key factors in his selection."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2028, "end": 2166, "text": "Data released by the party shows that Unterkoefler's appointment has already led to a significant surge in party membership and donations."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2167, "end": 2303, "text": "In the 24 hours following the announcement, the party's website saw a 500% increase in traffic, with over 10,000 new members signing up."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2304, "end": 2446, "text": "As Unterkoefler prepares to take the reins of the party, he faces a daunting task: uniting a fractured party and rebuilding trust with voters."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 23, "text": "Ernest Leo Unterkoefler"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 25, "end": 113, "text": "Ernest Leo Unterkoefler is a Catholic bishop who holds the position of auxiliary bishop."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 114, "end": 138, "text": "Early Life and Education"}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 140, "end": 230, "text": "Ernest Leo Unterkoefler was born on August 12, 1917, in Oak Park, Illinois, United States."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 231, "end": 328, "text": "He received his early education at Quigley Preparatory Seminary in Chicago and later attended St."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 329, "end": 378, "text": "Mary of the Lake Seminary in Mundelein, Illinois."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 379, "end": 395, "text": "Episcopal Career"}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 397, "end": 517, "text": "On June 29, 1964, Unterkoefler was ordained as a priest for the Archdiocese of Chicago by Cardinal Albert Gregory Meyer."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 518, "end": 648, "text": "He served in various capacities within the archdiocese, including as a parish priest and as a member of the archdiocesan tribunal."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 649, "end": 760, "text": "On November 22, 1967, Pope Paul VI appointed Unterkoefler as an auxiliary bishop of the Archdiocese of Chicago."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 761, "end": 858, "text": "He was consecrated as a bishop on January 25, 1968, by Cardinal John Cody, with Bishops Cletus F."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 859, "end": 922, "text": "O'Donnell and Aloysius John Wycislo serving as co-consecrators."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 923, "end": 1077, "text": "As an auxiliary bishop, Unterkoefler assisted the diocesan bishop of the Archdiocese of Chicago, Cardinal John Cody, in the governance of the archdiocese."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1078, "end": 1176, "text": "He did not have the right of succession to the archdiocese, as is the case with auxiliary bishops."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1177, "end": 1188, "text": "References:"}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1190, "end": 1218, "text": "* \"Ernest Leo Unterkoefler\"."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1219, "end": 1242, "text": "Catholic-Hierarchy.org."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1243, "end": 1264, "text": "Retrieved 2023-02-20."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1265, "end": 1300, "text": "* \"Bishop Ernest Leo Unterkoefler\"."}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1301, "end": 1315, "text": "GCatholic.org."}, "D2S21": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1316, "end": 1337, "text": "Retrieved 2023-02-20."}, "D2S22": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1338, "end": 1405, "text": "* \"The Catholic Church in the United States of America: 1959-1969\"."}, "D2S23": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1406, "end": 1447, "text": "The Catholic University of America Press."}, "D2S24": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1448, "end": 1453, "text": "1970."}, "D2S25": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1454, "end": 1456, "text": "p."}, "D2S26": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1457, "end": 1461, "text": "134."}, "D2S27": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1462, "end": 1498